"""Trader strategy: Screener quality-IC factor ensemble (unchanged 2026-12-17).

Cross-sectional composite across all 15 tradable benchmark assets; long-only,
fully invested (no cash sleeve). One target submitted daily via
rebalance_to_weights; the benchmark helper gates cadence (10d), turnover cost
(3bp one-way) and gross edge. Defensive tilt expressed through weights, never cash.

Active ensemble (from factor_ensemble.json, unchanged since 2026-11-19):
  beta_vix_60d_neg(+0.39), beta_cn10y_60d(-0.29), vol_of_vol20x60(+0.20),
  low_vol_20d(-0.12).

Trader-side guardrails (2026-12-17, preserving factor intent):
  1. Regime detector FIXED to return-based cross-asset drift (was price-level
     drift -> always "bull"; caused the 2026-12-03 regime mismatch).
  2. Per-asset weight cap at 12% (limits single-name blowup e.g. BTC/WTI).
  3. Defensive floor on XAU/US10Y/CN10Y (0.05 bull / 0.12 sideways / 0.25 bear).
  4. FIX 2026-12-31: normalize the selected top-K raw weights to sum 1 BEFORE
     apply_floor/apply_cap. Previously raw weights summed ~5.6, the cap
     saturated all 15 assets at 0.12 (sum 1.8) and final renormalization
     collapsed every proposal to flat 1/15 equal weight, nullifying the
     factor ensemble.
